  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "CB07121",
    "sub_id": "66102",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": null,
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>Midterm gets 30% as students seem to&nbsp; struggle&nbsp; to capture new concepts. Assignments get 30% including class attendance (5%) and all work (25%). The small quiz are are simple questions based on the lecture of the day. Final term has 40% has students tend to be very serious at the end of the semester. They can catch up if they did do well at the midterm exam.</div>\n",
    "course_pol": null,
    "course_pol_en": "Students should adhere to good behavior rules. They should try their best to avoid all misconducts including lying, cheating, unjustified absences, rudeness, etc. Additionally, phones should be set to silent mode. Whenever students need to delay submitting assignments or cannot attend class, they should notify the teacher via email (in English or Chinese). \n \n學生應該遵守良好行為的規則。他們應盡量避免所有不良行為，包括說謊、作弊、無故缺席、粗魯等。此外，手機應處於靜音模式。每當學生想要延遲作業提交或無法參加課堂時，他們應通過電子郵件（英文或中文）通知教師。由於這是一門基於電腦的課程，鼓勵學生在課堂上積極參與並注意重要概念。",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": null,
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>The FengChia University expects that students will conduct themselves in an honest and ethical manner and respect the intellectual work of others. In &nbsp;particular &nbsp;for this course, all forms of academic dishonesty are not allowed, including cheating on a test or an examination, plagiarism, improper collaboration on assignments, and so on.</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>逢甲大學期望學生以誠實和道德的方式行事，並尊重他人的智力成果。特別是對於本課程，不允許一切形式的學術不誠實行為，包括考試或考試作弊、抄襲、作業合作不當等。</div>\n</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "Y"
  },
